            "review_title": "Review at Yulong Mansion",
            "review_text": "Khanh\n2 contributions\n0\nOne of the Best Chinese Restaurants in Ha Long\nJun 2026 • Business\nHad a wonderful dining experience at Yulong Maison. The food was well-prepared, beautifully presented, and full of flavor. What stood out most was the attentive service and the warm hospitality from the team. The restaurant has a great atmosphere, making it perfect for both family gatherings and business dinners. Looking forward to coming back on my next visit to Ha Long.\nWritten June 6, 2026",
